  - ARAM (All Random, All Mid)
  - Teamfight Tactics (a free-for-all strategy game)
- **Customization**: Players can personalize their experience with different skins for champions.
- **Call to Action**: Multiple "Play Now" and "Play For Free" buttons encourage visitors to download and start playing.

